@node Raw API                     
@chapter API Reference for @code{(gucu raw)}

The the maximum extent possible, the raw @acronym{API} was designed to
match the C-language Ncurses API.  As such, an explanation of the
purpose and use of each variable and procedure will not be given here.  

First, there will be a description of how the various C types used by
Ncurses appear in Guile, and of the helper functions.

Afterwards, the API will be presented, with care to note when and how
the Ncurses C API and the @code{(gucu raw)} API diverge.

